---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/ui/PageHero.astro';
import CallToAction from '../../components/ui/CallToAction.astro';
import BoardMemberCard from '../../components/content/BoardMemberCard.astro';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';

const boardMembers = await getCollection('board-members');
const sortedBoardMembers = boardMembers.sort((a, b) => a.data.order - b.data.order);
const activeMembers = sortedBoardMembers.filter(m => m.data.role !== 'emeritus');
const emeritusMembers = sortedBoardMembers.filter(m => m.data.role === 'emeritus');
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="About" 
  description="The story of the Bluffline — six decades of advocacy, a historic merger, and a bold vision for Pensacola's multimodal future."
>
  <PageHero
    label="About"
    title="Six decades of advocacy. One transformative vision."
    description="The Bluffline is the product of generations of residents who believed Pensacola deserved better connections to its waterfront, its neighborhoods, and its natural landscape."
  />

  <section class="section purpose-section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="purpose-content">
        <p class="purpose-statement">We exist to help Pensacola residents reconnect with their bodies, their environment, and each other.</p>
        <p>That purpose drives everything we do—from the infrastructure we build to the policies we advocate for to the way we engage with the communities we serve. We believe that safe, accessible paths for walking and cycling aren't luxuries. They're essential infrastructure for healthy, thriving neighborhoods.</p>
        <p>Our vision is a Pensacola where all our neighbors have access to safe active transit infrastructure, attainable workforce housing, economic opportunity, and a healthy environment. The Bluffline is how we get there.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section history-section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>A Vision Six Decades in the Making</h2>
        <p>The idea of connecting Pensacola's bluffs to the bay isn't new. For generations, advocates have championed this corridor—through newspaper editorials, planning studies, and grassroots organizing.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
          <div class="timeline-date">1960s–1980s</div>
          <h3>Early Advocacy</h3>
          <p>Pensacola News Journal editor J. Earle Bowden begins decades of editorial advocacy for preserving the scenic bay bluffs and creating public access along the waterfront. His vision plants the seeds for what would become a regional movement.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
          <div class="timeline-date">1998</div>
          <h3>Florida Scenic Highway Program</h3>
          <p>Florida creates its scenic highway program, offering a framework for protecting and enhancing corridors with outstanding natural, cultural, and historic resources.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
          <div class="timeline-date">2008</div>
          <h3>Scenic Bluffs Designated</h3>
          <p>The Pensacola Scenic Bay Bluffs corridor earns official designation as a Florida Scenic Highway—a victory for preservation advocates, but the multimodal trail vision remains unrealized.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
          <div class="timeline-date">2008–2020</div>
          <h3>A Vision Deferred</h3>
          <p>While the scenic highway program succeeds in protecting the corridor's character, efforts to build an actual trail stall repeatedly. The scenic highway has a managing organization; the trail does not.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
          <div class="timeline-date">2021</div>
          <h3>Bluffline, Inc. Founded</h3>
          <p>A group of advocates incorporates Bluffline, Inc. as a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization, creating the dedicated entity needed to advance the multimodal vision that had languished for decades.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section merger-section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="merger-grid">
        <div class="merger-content">
          <h2>The 2024 Merger: Taking the Baton</h2>
          <p>In 2024, the Pensacola Scenic Highway Foundation—stewards of the scenic byway since its designation—merged with Bluffline, Inc. This wasn't an acquisition. It was a passing of the torch.</p>
          <p>The Foundation's leadership recognized that the corridor's future required an organization focused not just on preservation, but on building new infrastructure. By joining forces, we combined decades of institutional knowledge with fresh momentum and a clear multimodal mission.</p>
          <p>Today, Bluffline, Inc. serves as the Corridor Management Entity for the Pensacola Scenic Bay Bluffs Scenic Highway—and the driving force behind the 20-mile greenway that will finally connect NAS Pensacola to UWF.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="merger-highlight">
          <h3>What the Merger Means</h3>
          <div class="merger-stat">
            <div class="merger-stat-value">16+ years</div>
            <div class="merger-stat-label">of scenic highway stewardship transferred</div>
          </div>
          <div class="merger-stat">
            <div class="merger-stat-value">One organization</div>
            <div class="merger-stat-label">for preservation and construction</div>
          </div>
          <div class="merger-stat">
            <div class="merger-stat-value">Unified voice</div>
            <div class="merger-stat-label">for the corridor's future</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section values-section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Our Values</h2>
        <p>These principles guide every decision we make—from how we engage with communities to how we steward public resources.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="values-grid">
        <div class="value-card">
          <div class="value-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Interdependence</h3>
          <p>Our community thrives when all our neighbors are happy, healthy, and whole.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <div class="value-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Respect</h3>
          <p>Every life is sacred. Every perspective is unique and valuable.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <div class="value-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Self-Determination</h3>
          <p>Every neighborhood deserves a say in decisions that affect them.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <div class="value-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/><line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="3"/><line x1="12" y1="21" x2="12" y2="23"/><line x1="4.22" y1="4.22" x2="5.64" y2="5.64"/><line x1="18.36" y1="18.36" x2="19.78" y2="19.78"/><line x1="1" y1="12" x2="3" y2="12"/><line x1="21" y1="12" x2="23" y2="12"/><line x1="4.22" y1="19.78" x2="5.64" y2="18.36"/><line x1="18.36" y1="5.64" x2="19.78" y2="4.22"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Transparency</h3>
          <p>Sunlight is the best disinfectant and the surest path to accountability.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <div class="value-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"/><path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"/><path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Sustainability</h3>
          <p>We build for future generations and consider those who come after us.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section leadership-section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Board & Leadership</h2>
        <p>Bluffline, Inc. is governed by a volunteer board of directors who bring expertise in finance, law, environmental stewardship, and community engagement.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="leadership-grid">
        {activeMembers.map((member) => (
          <BoardMemberCard
            name={member.data.name}
            title={member.data.title}
            role={member.data.role}
            bio={member.data.bio}
            photo={member.data.photo}
          />
        ))}
      </div>

      {emeritusMembers.length > 0 && (
        <div class="emeritus-section">
          <div class="emeritus-header">
            <h3>Founders & Emeritus</h3>
            <p>We honor those whose vision and early leadership made Bluffline, Inc. possible.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="emeritus-grid">
            {emeritusMembers.map((member) => (
              <BoardMemberCard
                name={member.data.name}
                title={member.data.title}
                role={member.data.role}
                bio={member.data.bio}
                photo={member.data.photo}
              />
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      )}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section documents-section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Documents & Transparency</h2>
        <p>Transparency is one of our core values. Here you'll find our public accountability documents and organizational filings.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="documents-grid">
        <a href="/documents/form-990.pdf" class="document-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <div class="document-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="document-content">
            <h3>Form 990</h3>
            <p>IRS annual return</p>
          </div>
          <div class="document-arrow">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"/><line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"/></svg>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="/documents/irs-determination-letter.pdf" class="document-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <div class="document-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="document-content">
            <h3>IRS Determination Letter</h3>
            <p>501(c)(3) status</p>
          </div>
          <div class="document-arrow">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"/><line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"/></svg>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="/documents/annual-reports" class="document-card">
          <div class="document-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="document-content">
            <h3>Annual Reports</h3>
            <p>Yearly organizational updates</p>
          </div>
          <div class="document-arrow">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="https://www.guidestar.org/profile/shared/c5cc3f03-5a18-4f14-89f3-4b194e00c2de" class="document-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <div class="document-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="document-content">
            <h3>GuideStar Profile</h3>
            <p>Verified nonprofit</p>
          </div>
          <div class="document-arrow">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"/><line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"/></svg>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CallToAction
    title="Join the movement"
    description="The Bluffline is community-driven. Whether you volunteer, donate, or show up to planning meetings, your participation shapes the outcome."
    primaryLabel="Get Involved"
    primaryHref="/support"
  />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .purpose-section { background: var(--cream); }
  .purpose-content { max-width: 800px; }
  .purpose-statement {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .purpose-content p { font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; color: var(--navy); opacity: 0.85; }

  .history-section { background: var(--warm-white); }
  .timeline { max-width: 700px; position: relative; padding-left: 2rem; }
  .timeline::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 7px;
    top: 8px;
    bottom: 8px;
    width: 2px;
    background: var(--spring);
  }
  .timeline-item { position: relative; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
  .timeline-marker {
    position: absolute;
    left: -2rem;
    top: 6px;
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    background: var(--spring);
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 3px solid var(--warm-white);
  }
  .timeline-date {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--forest);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .timeline-item h3 { font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .timeline-item p { color: var(--navy); opacity: 0.75; }

  .merger-section { background: var(--mist); }
  .merger-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 3rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .merger-grid { grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr; gap: 4rem; }
  }
  .merger-content h2 { font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.25rem); color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .merger-content p { font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; color: var(--navy); opacity: 0.85; }
  .merger-highlight {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 2rem;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(45, 48, 71, 0.06);
  }
  .merger-highlight h3 { font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .merger-stat { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .merger-stat:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .merger-stat-value {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--forest);
  }
  .merger-stat-label { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--navy); opacity: 0.7; }

  /* Values Section */
  .values-section { background: var(--warm-white); }
  .values-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .values-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .values-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
  }
  .value-card {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 1.75rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(45, 48, 71, 0.06);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }
  .value-card:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(45, 48, 71, 0.06);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .value-icon {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    background: var(--mist);
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .value-icon svg { width: 24px; height: 24px; color: var(--forest); }
  .value-card h3 {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .value-card p { font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--navy); opacity: 0.75; line-height: 1.5; }

  /* Leadership Section */
  .leadership-section { background: var(--mist); }
  .leadership-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .leadership-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .leadership-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 2rem; }
  }

  /* Emeritus Section */
  .emeritus-section {
    margin-top: 4rem;
    padding-top: 3rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(45, 48, 71, 0.1);
  }
  .emeritus-header {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .emeritus-header h3 {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .emeritus-header p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--navy);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
  .emeritus-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .emeritus-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .emeritus-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
  }

  /* Documents Section */
  .documents-section { background: var(--cream); }
  .documents-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .documents-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem; }
  }
  .document-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    background: white;
    border-radius: 12px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(45, 48, 71, 0.04);
  }
  .document-card:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(45, 48, 71, 0.08);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .document-icon {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    background: var(--mist);
    border-radius: 10px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .document-icon svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; color: var(--forest); }
  .document-content { flex: 1; }
  .document-content h3 {
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 0.125rem;
  }
  .document-content p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--navy);
    opacity: 0.6;
  }
  .document-arrow {
    opacity: 0.3;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }
  .document-arrow svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; color: var(--forest); }
  .document-card:hover .document-arrow {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }
</style>
